ption and keeps receiving `compiledRoute`. The option is declared in the zod schema (`schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts:287`), the tool descriptor (`tools/advisor-recommend.ts:23`) and the CLI manifest (`skill-advisor-cli-manifest.ts:57`).\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 36]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"limit\":3,\"offset\":33,\"path\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/cli-surface/advisor-recommend.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794558916982,"end":1794558918671}}}}
